						&lt;/span&gt;
						&lt;br&gt;
						Defines the availability of the Highlight feature for the site.
					</xs:documentation>
					<xs:appinfo>
						<CallInfo>
							<CallName>GeteBayDetails</CallName>
							<Returned>Always</Returned>
