						filtering the buyer used when setting up a Saved Search in My eBay.
					</xs:documentation>
					<xs:appinfo>
						<CallInfo>
							<CallName>GetMyeBayBuying</CallName>
							<Details>DetailLevel: none, ReturnAll</Details>
							<Returned>Conditionally</Returned>
