						specify whether you want to include charity listings, free-shipping listings, and
						listings with other features in your search.
					</xs:documentation>
					<xs:appinfo>
						<CallInfo>
							<CallName>GetMyeBayBuying</CallName>
							<Details>DetailLevel: none, ReturnAll</Details>
