					</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:enumeration>
			<xs:enumeration value="DirectDebit">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>
						This enumeration value indicates that eBay will debit the bank account on file to process the eBay user's monthly invoice.
