						&lt;/code&gt;
						&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
						In all cases, both the &lt;b&gt;WeightMajor&lt;/b&gt; and &lt;b&gt;WeightMinor&lt;/b&gt; should be specified in an Add/Revise/Relist/Verify call, even if either's value is '0'.
